"subscriptions. In the event of a price change applicable to ongoing "
"subscriptions, the user will be notified by email with at least 30 days' "
"advance notice before the new price takes effect. The new price will "
"apply upon the next renewal following the notice period. Users who do not"
" agree to the price change remain free to cancel their subscription "
"without charge before the effective date of the new price, directly from "
"their account management area."

#: project/templates/mentions-legales.html:272
